    "id": 1001,
    "definition": {
      "type": "note",
      "content": "## InterSystems IRIS\n\nThis dashboard tracks IRIS instance health, high availability (mirroring), distributed caching (ECP), and interoperability productions.\n\n- **Mirror**, **ECP**, and **outbound HTTP** sections show *No data* when those features are not in use — this is expected.\n- Event-style signals (failovers, process termination, license warnings) appear in the **Logs** section via the `messages.log` pipeline.\n\n[Setup & docs](https://docs.datadoghq.com/integrations/intersystems_iris/)",
      "background_color": "white",
      "font_size": "14",
      "text_align": "left",
      "vertical_align": "top",
      "show_tick": false,
      "tick_pos": "50%",
      "tick_edge": "left",
      "has_padding": true
    },
    "layout": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 12, "height": 2 }
  }
